## 🖼️ Otimização de Imagens

### **✅ DO: Boas Práticas de Imagens**

```typescript
// ✅ DO: Formatos modernos (WebP, AVIF)
<picture>
  <source srcSet="/image.avif" type="image/avif" />
  <source srcSet="/image.webp" type="image/webp" />
  <img src="/image.jpg" alt="Image" title="Image" loading="lazy" />
</picture>

// ✅ DO: Responsive images com srcSet
<img
  srcSet="/image-320w.webp 320w,
          /image-640w.webp 640w,
          /image-1280w.webp 1280w"
  sizes="(max-width: 640px) 320px,
         (max-width: 1280px) 640px,
         1280px"
  src="/image-1280w.webp"
  alt="Image"
  title="Image"
  loading="lazy"
/>

// ✅ DO: Dimensões explícitas para prevenir CLS
<img
  src="/image.webp"
  alt="Image"
  title="Image"
  width={800}
  height={600}
  loading="lazy"
/>
```

